;; v0.1 config-cage deferral (AC-0046): the caged agent uses the host's real Claude
;; account state. ~/.claude is a --add-dirs RW mount; this fragment grants the
;; file-level RW on ~/.claude.json* (the prefix regex also covers Claude's sibling
